          "amp": "0015999445633321200000004898876512306977654796653430134437987799734577643332320000000000000000004496444666300000048855765425667963798643222222000000"
        },
        {
          "who": "A",
          "text": "Nice! How was the journey?",
          "bn": "দারুণ! যাত্রা কেমন ছিল?",
